{
  "name": "thetacog-mcp-source",
  "version": "2.58.3",
  "description": "Write the job down as a spec, and every change your AI agent makes is placed against it on a record the agent did not write: in lane, flagged, or a breach. Anyone can rerun it and get the same answer. Free and open source (MIT); the VS Code extension is ThetaCog Steer. Try it: npx -y thetacog-mcp@latest attest-demo",
